@startuml state_appointment
' --------------------------------------------------------------
' State Diagram - Appointment Lifecycle
' --------------------------------------------------------------
title Clinix - Appointment Lifecycle (State Diagram)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Helvetica, sans-serif"
skinparam StateBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EAF2F9
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

[*] --> Pending : Patient submits booking

Pending --> Confirmed : Payment succeeded\n(CamPay webhook)
Pending --> Cancelled : Payment failed /\nuser cancels

Confirmed --> InProgress : Consultation started\n(provider joins call)
Confirmed --> Cancelled  : Either party cancels\nbefore start
Confirmed --> NoShow     : Scheduled time elapsed\nwith no join

InProgress --> Completed : Provider ends consultation\n+ notes saved
InProgress --> Cancelled : Connection lost /\nprovider aborts

Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
NoShow    --> [*]
@enduml
